                • For ≤ 14 electrons (B₂, C₂, N₂): π(2p_x) = π(2p_y) lies below σ(2p_z) due to s-p mixing.

                • For > 14 electrons (O₂, F₂): σ(2p_z) lies below π(2p_x) = π(2p_y).

                • O₂ (BO = 2.0, paramagnetic, 2 unpaired e⁻); O₂⁺ (BO = 2.5); O₂⁻ (BO = 1.5); O₂²⁻ (BO = 1.0, diamagnetic).

